{"MaqraNumber":150.0,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":181,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"۞أَوۡفُواْ ٱلۡكَيۡلَ وَلَا تَكُونُواْ مِنَ ٱلۡمُخۡسِرِينَ","TajweedText":"۞ أَوْفُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْكَيْلَ وَلَا تَكُونُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُخْسِر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٨١</span>","End":"١٨١","PageNumber":374,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":325,"MaqraNumber":150,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":182,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَزِنُواْ بِٱلۡقِسۡطَاسِ ٱلۡمُسۡتَقِيمِ","TajweedText":"وَزِنُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْقِسْطَاسِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُسْتَق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مِ <span class=end>١٨٢</span>","End":"١٨٢","PageNumber":374,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":325,"MaqraNumber":150,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":183,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَا تَبۡخَسُواْ ٱلنَّاسَ أَشۡيَآءَهُمۡ وَلَا تَعۡثَوۡاْ فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ مُفۡسِدِينَ","TajweedText":"وَلَا تَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>خَسُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َاسَ أَشْي<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَهُمْ وَلَا تَعْثَوْ<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ مُفْسِد<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٨٣</span>","End":"١٨٣","PageNumber":374,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":325,"MaqraNumber":150,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":184,"ShowSurahName":